    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nugent Auctioneers, 045 865 555, www.nugents.ie  now present to the market this enticing four-bedroom detached bungalow, located in Tuckmill Lower and set on a generous site of approximately 1.7 acres with a mature garden featuring an extensive selection of established trees, shrubs and flowers, creating a beautiful and private setting. This property is sure to appeal to those with equestrian or horticultural interests.\r\n\r\nThe property requires modernisation, offering the new owner an excellent opportunity to enhance its existing appeal and put their own stamp on this charming family home. The bungalow provides spacious accommodation ideally suited to family living, while enjoying a peaceful and tranquil rural setting with stunning, uninterrupted mountain views from each of the front-facing rooms.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property offers an abundance of options, with a range of useful outbuildings including a detached shed, fuel outhouse and an extra-large attached garage measuring over 70 sq. m. There is also an agricultural shed located in the rear paddock, providing excellent additional storage and potential for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nSituated along the L8291 at Tuckmill Lower, the property enjoys quick and convenient access to the N81 road, approximately 2km away, making it ideal for commuters. Baltinglass town is just 5km from the property and offers a wide range of amenities including supermarkets, schools, restaurants, pubs, sporting facilities and much more. The property is also located less than 50km from Dublin and the M50 motorway, offering convenient access to the capital and surrounding areas. This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious detached bungalow on a substantial site, in a peaceful rural location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\t\t4.59m x 1.66m\t\tCarpet \r\nSitting Room\t\t5.16m x2.76m\t\tCarpet, open fireplace \r\nKitchen\t/ Dining Area\t3.93m x 3.87m\t\tTiled floor, ample storage\r\nLiving Area\t\t5.16m x 3.32m \t\tCarpet, stove\r\nBedroom 1\t\t4.27m x 3.34m\t\tCarpet, built in wardrobe \r\nBedroom 2\t\t3.34m x 3.18m\t\tBuilt in wardrobe, carpet \r\nBathroom                         2.50m x 3.20m                 Fully tiled, bath, shower cubicle, W.C & W.H.B \r\nBedroom 3\t\t3.18m x 2.42m\t\tCarpet \r\nBedroom 4\t\t3.19m x 2.50m\t\tCarpet \r\nUtility Room\t\t3.85m x 3.40m\t\tTiled floor, plumbed for utlities \r\nGuest W.C\t\t1.94m x 0. 81m\t\tW.C & W.H.B \r\nBack Porch\t\t3.39m x 3.30m\t\tDoor to back, tiled floor, guest wc off \r\nDetached Garage\t6.10m x 4.90m \r\nFuel House\t\t1.97m x 1.20m\r\nAttached Garage\t5.78m x 2.08m \r\nAttached Garage\t8.80m x 6.97m"
